text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT OF\r\nRADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGING<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<h3 align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>RADIOGRAPH OF BOTH SHOULDER LAT<\/span><\/h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n--------No obvious bony injury or abnormality seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nNo obvious periarticular calcific fleck is <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nvisualised.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n--------Gleno-humeral and acromio-clavicular joint spaces are<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\npreserved.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\n--------Soft tissue planes around shoulder joint are intact.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 IMPRESSION<\/span><\/b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 : NORMAL STUDY.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoPlainText><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt'>&nbsp